    <content>
      <![CDATA[<p><img src="https://i.postimg.cc/W4TSH0WC/html5-Semantic-tags-header.png" alt="HTML 語意化標籤怎麼用？新手最常搞錯的 5 個地方"></p><h2 id="前言"><a href="#前言" class="headerlink" title="前言"></a>前言</h2><p>在剛開始學 HTML 時，多數人都會習慣用 <code>&lt;div&gt;</code> 把所有內容包起來。<br>但當專案變大、結構變複雜時，你可能會開始遇到這些問題：</p><ul><li>HTML 結構難以閱讀  </li><li>SEO 表現不佳  </li><li>螢幕閱讀器無法正確解析內容</li></ul><p>這時候，「語意化標籤（Semantic HTML）」就不只是語法，而是<strong>結構設計能力</strong>。</p><hr><h2 id="什麼是-HTML-語意化？"><a href="#什麼是-HTML-語意化？" class="headerlink" title="什麼是 HTML 語意化？"></a>什麼是 HTML 語意化？</h2><p>HTML 語意化（Semantic HTML）指的是使用「有意義的標籤」來描述內容結構，而不是單純用 <code>&lt;div&gt;</code> 排版。</p><p>👉 目標很簡單：讓「人」與「機器（搜尋引擎、輔助工具）」都能理解你的頁面。</p><hr><h2 id="新手最常搞錯的-5-個地方"><a href="#新手最常搞錯的-5-個地方" class="headerlink" title="新手最常搞錯的 5 個地方"></a>新手最常搞錯的 5 個地方</h2><h3 id="❌-錯誤-1：全部都用"><a href="#❌-錯誤-1：全部都用" class="headerlink" title="❌ 錯誤 1：全部都用 &lt;div&gt;"></a>❌ 錯誤 1：全部都用 <code>&lt;div&gt;</code></h3><p>很多人一開始會這樣寫：</p><figure class="highlight html"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">div</span>&gt;</span>header<span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">div</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">div</span>&gt;</span>nav<span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">div</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">div</span>&gt;</span>content<span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">div</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">div</span>&gt;</span>footer<span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">div</span>&gt;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>👉 問題：</p><ul><li>SEO 無法理解頁面結構</li><li>無障礙工具難以解析</li><li>可讀性差</li></ul><p>✅ 建議改成：</p><figure class="highlight html"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">header</span>&gt;</span>header<span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">header</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">nav</span>&gt;</span>nav<span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">nav</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">main</span>&gt;</span>main<span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">main</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">footer</span>&gt;</span>footer<span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">footer</span>&gt;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>👉 語意化的重點不是外觀，而是「結構」。</p><hr><h3 id="❌-錯誤-2：把-當萬用容器"><a href="#❌-錯誤-2：把-當萬用容器" class="headerlink" title="❌ 錯誤 2：把 &lt;section&gt; 當萬用容器"></a>❌ 錯誤 2：把 <code>&lt;section&gt;</code> 當萬用容器</h3><p>很多人會把 <code>&lt;section&gt;</code> 當成有語意的 <code>&lt;div&gt;</code></p><p>👉 問題：</p><ul><li>沒有標題 → 幾乎等於 div</li><li>結構不清楚</li></ul><p>✅ 正確用法：</p><figure class="highlight html"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">section</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">h2</span>&gt;</span>產品介紹<span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">h2</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">p</span>&gt;</span>內容...<span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">p</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">section</span>&gt;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>👉 重點：<code>&lt;section&gt;</code> 通常應該要有標題。但有例外——如果是獨立功能區塊（像是搜尋結果列表、地圖元件），即使沒有標題也可以使用 <code>&lt;section&gt;</code>，因為沒有更具體的標籤來代替它。</p><hr><h3 id="❌-錯誤-3：搞不清-vs"><a href="#❌-錯誤-3：搞不清-vs" class="headerlink" title="❌ 錯誤 3：搞不清 &lt;article&gt; vs &lt;section&gt;"></a>❌ 錯誤 3：搞不清 <code>&lt;article&gt;</code> vs <code>&lt;section&gt;</code></h3><p>這是最多人卡住的地方。</p><p>👉 記一個最簡單判斷：</p><ul><li>可以獨立存在、拿去別的地方也成立 → <code>&lt;article&gt;</code></li><li>只是頁面或文章的某個分段 → <code>&lt;section&gt;</code></li></ul><p>例如：</p><figure class="highlight html"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">article</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">h2</span>&gt;</span>一篇文章<span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">h2</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">article</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">section</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">h2</span>&gt;</span>相關文章<span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">h2</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">section</span>&gt;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>👉 <code>&lt;article&gt;</code> 可以被拿去別的地方使用（像 RSS 訂閱、文章列表），拿出來單獨看也有完整意義。</p><p>💡 <strong>還有一點新手容易忽略：兩者可以互相嵌套。</strong></p><ul><li><code>&lt;article&gt;</code> 裡面可以有多個 <code>&lt;section&gt;</code>（一篇文章分成多個段落）</li><li><code>&lt;section&gt;</code> 裡面也可以有多個 <code>&lt;article&gt;</code>（一個評論區裡有多則留言）</li></ul><figure class="highlight html"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment">&lt;!-- article 包 section：一篇文章分段 --&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">article</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">h2</span>&gt;</span>文章標題<span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">h2</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">section</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">h3</span>&gt;</span>第一段<span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">h3</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">p</span>&gt;</span>內容...<span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">p</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">section</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">section</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">h3</span>&gt;</span>第二段<span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">h3</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">p</span>&gt;</span>內容...<span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">p</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">section</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">article</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line"> </span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment">&lt;!-- section 包 article：評論區有多則留言 --&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">section</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">h2</span>&gt;</span>讀者留言<span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">h2</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">article</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">p</span>&gt;</span>第一則留言<span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">p</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">article</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">article</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">p</span>&gt;</span>第二則留言<span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">p</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">article</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">section</span>&gt;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><hr><h3 id="❌-錯誤-4：濫用"><a href="#❌-錯誤-4：濫用" class="headerlink" title="❌ 錯誤 4：濫用 &lt;nav&gt;"></a>❌ 錯誤 4：濫用 <code>&lt;nav&gt;</code></h3><p>有些人會把任何「有互動的東西」都放進 <code>&lt;nav&gt;</code>。</p><p>👉 常見誤用情境：</p><figure class="highlight html"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment">&lt;!-- ❌ 把麵包屑導覽或分頁直接包進 nav --&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">nav</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">a</span> <span class="attr">href</span>=<span class="string">&quot;#&quot;</span>&gt;</span>上一頁<span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">a</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">a</span> <span class="attr">href</span>=<span class="string">&quot;#&quot;</span>&gt;</span>下一頁<span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">a</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">nav</span>&gt;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>👉 <code>&lt;nav&gt;</code> 應該只用於<strong>網站主要導航</strong>（全域選單、頁尾選單等），分頁（pagination）或上一篇 &#x2F; 下一篇連結屬於輔助導航，建議用 <code>&lt;section&gt;</code> 包起來，或加上 <code>aria-label</code> 區分。</p><p>✅ 正確用法：</p><figure class="highlight html"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment">&lt;!-- 主導覽列 --&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">nav</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">a</span> <span class="attr">href</span>=<span class="string">&quot;/&quot;</span>&gt;</span>首頁<span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">a</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">a</span> <span class="attr">href</span>=<span class="string">&quot;/blog&quot;</span>&gt;</span>文章<span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">a</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">nav</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line"> </span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment">&lt;!-- 分頁導覽 --&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">section</span> <span class="attr">aria-label</span>=<span class="string">&quot;分頁&quot;</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">a</span> <span class="attr">href</span>=<span class="string">&quot;#&quot;</span>&gt;</span>上一頁<span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">a</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">a</span> <span class="attr">href</span>=<span class="string">&quot;#&quot;</span>&gt;</span>下一頁<span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">a</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">section</span>&gt;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><hr><h3 id="❌-錯誤-5：亂用"><a href="#❌-錯誤-5：亂用" class="headerlink" title="❌ 錯誤 5：亂用 &lt;main&gt;"></a>❌ 錯誤 5：亂用 <code>&lt;main&gt;</code></h3><p>👉 <code>&lt;main&gt;</code> 有幾個重要限制：</p><ul><li>一個頁面只能有一個 <code>&lt;main&gt;</code></li><li>不應該放在 <code>&lt;header&gt;</code>、<code>&lt;footer&gt;</code>、<code>&lt;nav&gt;</code>、<code>&lt;article&gt;</code>、<code>&lt;aside&gt;</code> 裡</li></ul><p>✅ 正確結構：</p><figure class="highlight html"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">body</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">header</span>&gt;</span><span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">header</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">nav</span>&gt;</span><span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">nav</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">main</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">    主要內容</span><br><span class="line">  <span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">main</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">footer</span>&gt;</span><span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">footer</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">body</span>&gt;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>👉 <code>&lt;main&gt;</code> 代表「這頁最重要的內容」，搜尋引擎和螢幕閱讀器都會優先解析它。</p><hr><h2 id="我到底該用哪個標籤？"><a href="#我到底該用哪個標籤？" class="headerlink" title="我到底該用哪個標籤？"></a>我到底該用哪個標籤？</h2><p>快速判斷：</p><ul><li>主內容 → <code>&lt;main&gt;</code></li><li>導覽 → <code>&lt;nav&gt;</code></li><li>獨立內容（可單獨存在） → <code>&lt;article&gt;</code></li><li>區塊分段（頁面的一部分） → <code>&lt;section&gt;</code></li><li>補充資訊（不影響主內容） → <code>&lt;aside&gt;</code></li><li>頁首 &#x2F; 頁尾 → <code>&lt;header&gt;</code> &#x2F; <code>&lt;footer&gt;</code></li><li>如果只是為了排版或樣式，沒有語意 → 用 <code>&lt;div&gt;</code></li></ul><hr><p>🧩 常見但容易忽略的語意標籤</p><ul><li><code>&lt;aside&gt;</code>：補充資訊，例如推薦文章、作者資訊、廣告區塊。<strong>注意：不一定要放在側邊位置才能用，重點是「內容與主體沒有直接關係」。</strong></li><li><code>&lt;time&gt;</code>：日期時間</li><li><code>&lt;mark&gt;</code>：重點標記</li><li><code>&lt;figure&gt;</code> + <code>&lt;figcaption&gt;</code>：圖片與說明文字</li></ul><p>⚠️ <code>&lt;hgroup&gt;</code> 已較少使用，不建議使用</p><hr><h2 id="一個完整語意化範例"><a href="#一個完整語意化範例" class="headerlink" title="一個完整語意化範例"></a>一個完整語意化範例</h2><figure class="highlight html"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br><span class="line">30</span><br><span class="line">31</span><br><span class="line">32</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">body</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">header</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">h1</span>&gt;</span>網站標題<span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">h1</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">header</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">nav</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">a</span> <span class="attr">href</span>=<span class="string">&quot;#&quot;</span>&gt;</span>首頁<span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">a</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">a</span> <span class="attr">href</span>=<span class="string">&quot;#&quot;</span>&gt;</span>文章<span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">a</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">nav</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">main</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">article</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">h2</span>&gt;</span>文章標題<span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">h2</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">section</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">h3</span>&gt;</span>段落一<span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">h3</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">p</span>&gt;</span>內容...<span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">p</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">section</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">section</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">h3</span>&gt;</span>段落二<span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">h3</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">p</span>&gt;</span>內容...<span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">p</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">section</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">article</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">aside</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">h2</span>&gt;</span>相關文章<span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">h2</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">ul</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">li</span>&gt;</span><span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">a</span> <span class="attr">href</span>=<span class="string">&quot;#&quot;</span>&gt;</span>推薦閱讀 1<span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">a</span>&gt;</span><span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">li</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">li</span>&gt;</span><span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">a</span> <span class="attr">href</span>=<span class="string">&quot;#&quot;</span>&gt;</span>推薦閱讀 2<span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">a</span>&gt;</span><span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">li</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">ul</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">aside</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">main</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">footer</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">    版權資訊</span><br><span class="line">  <span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">footer</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">body</span>&gt;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><hr><h2 id="總結"><a href="#總結" class="headerlink" title="總結"></a>總結</h2><p>語意化標籤不是「把 div 換名字」而已。</p><p>👉 重點是：</p><ul><li>讓結構更清楚</li><li>讓搜尋引擎看得懂</li><li>讓程式碼更好維護</li></ul><p>如果你只是把 <code>&lt;div&gt;</code> 換成 <code>&lt;section&gt;</code>，其實沒有比較好。</p><p>真正的差別在於：你有沒有在「設計結構」</p><p>如果你之前也是「div 切天下」，那這篇應該會幫你釐清不少觀念。</p><p>如果有其他語意化標籤的問題，或實務上不知道怎麼選標籤，也歡迎留言一起討論。</p>]]>
